WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A room walkthrough and a spoken request become a structured edit pipeline.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
This is a hand-authored command fixture, not speech-model output.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The real adapter maps 15.2 seconds at 30 fps to frame 456 and resolves red to RGB.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The source connects audio, vision editing, and reconstruction; model inference is not run here.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Reproduce the adapter and regression checks locally; full GPU inference remains separate.
